{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Futuro Darko Racer</strong> is a fast-paced racing game with shooting elements, inspired by the comic FUTURO DARKO by Krzysztof Nowak, published by Nagle! Comics. The game takes place in post-apocalyptic wastelands, where every race is a fight for survival. To win, you must outrun your opponents or simply destroy them! But beware \u2014 ruthless judges are watching to enforce the rules. If anyone catches you cheating, you\u2019ll become the target and be eliminated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5\u00a0<strong>Game modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally \u2013 a classic gun race. You can be the first to win... or eliminate everyone when the judges aren't looking.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the Law \u2013 the police don't forget. Escape through the wasteland before they take your cash and freedom.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounty Hunter \u2013 pursue and destroy your designated target. Bosses don't give up easily.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Arena \u2013 one track, no rules. Survive or burn with the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Personalization and progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your vehicle - from the hood to the exhaust. Each victory increases your esteem, and with it, access to new parts and weapons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put cash or your own car as collateral. In Futuro Darko Racer, risk is currency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Story mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the American wasteland divided into zones - from rusty suburbs to futuristic metropolises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet gangs, bounty hunters, corrupt judges and freaks who have long lost faith in the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132090/extras/5a7630e229d202e053a58403ac2d88fa.poster.avif?t=1762330443\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132090/extras/5a7630e229d202e053a58403ac2d88fa.webm?t=1762330443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132090/extras/5a7630e229d202e053a58403ac2d88fa.mp4?t=1762330443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Why it's worth it</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >graphic style inspired by comics book FURURO DARKO</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dynamic racing with fighting and shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >extensive tuning and improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >risk and betting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >full story campaign</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Futuro Darko Racer \u2013 drive, fight, survive. Or go down with the engine!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132090?t=1762330443","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132090/cdce6f8f6a71bd6f41c37f309e5412b6baabaf87/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762330443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132090/36110575935df7de57dc6a96db8caba12b946147/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762330443"